  "referenceNumber": "RUS3724",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers there are reasonable grounds to suspect that Aleksandr Sergeevich CHICHKAN (hereafter CHICHKAN) is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the grounds that he is or has been involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine as a person who is responsible for, engages in, provides support for, or promotes policies or actions which destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. Namely, for carrying out the unlawful detention, interrogation and mistreatment of a Ukrainian civilian, while serving in the Russian military commandant’s office in the Kherson region. \n",
